# Nebius Token Factory (OpenAI-compatible) — never commit real keys
# Console: https://tokenfactory.nebius.com/
# Docs:    https://docs.tokenfactory.nebius.com/api-reference/introduction

# --- Create an API key ---
# 1. Open Token Factory → API keys → Create API key → name it → Create
# 2. Copy the key immediately (it cannot be viewed again)
# 3. Paste below (or export NEBIUS_API_KEY in your shell)

NEBIUS_API_KEY=

# OpenAI-compatible base URL (trailing slash optional; code normalizes it)
# Global / eu-north1 default:
NEBIUS_BASE_URL=https://api.tokenfactory.nebius.com/v1/
# Regional examples (use if your model lives there):
# NEBIUS_BASE_URL=https://api.tokenfactory.us-central1.nebius.com/v1/
# NEBIUS_BASE_URL=https://api.tokenfactory.eu-west1.nebius.com/v1/

# Default: efficient Nemotron for agents (catalog id is correct as written)
NEBIUS_MODEL=nvidia/Nemotron-3_5-Lightning
# Other NVIDIA Nemotron IDs currently on Token Factory (Oct 2026 catalog):
# NEBIUS_MODEL=nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B
# NEBIUS_MODEL=nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b
# NEBIUS_MODEL=nvidia/Nemotron-3-Ultra-550b-a55b
# Catalog: https://tokenfactory.nebius.com/model-catalog.md

# --- Hackathon promo credits ---
# Code: NEBIUS-DEVPOST-GLOBAL26  (~$25 Token Factory credits)
# Apply: Token Factory → balance → Top up → With promo code → enter code → Top up
# Resources: https://nebiusglobalaihackathon.devpost.com/resources
# Optional: another $25 via Nebius Builders Program (see Devpost resources)

# Optional: path to MQEA-EW sibling checkout (default /workspace/mqea_ew on the box)
# MQEA_EW_ROOT=/workspace/mqea_ew
